User-&gt;&gt;&gt;AV: type a question
AV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: ask(question)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC: handle(AgentTask CHAT)
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;MM: buildContext(task)
MM-&gt;&gt;&gt;CM: recent()
CM.&gt;MM: recent messages
MM-&gt;&gt;&gt;UM: getProtectedCategories()
UM.&gt;MM: preferences
MM.&gt;AC: AgentContext
combinedFragment=loop~cf1 AC T; AC:       [until FinalAnswerStep or maxSteps reached]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;PL: nextStep(ctx)
combinedFragment=alt~cf2 AC T; AC:        [question is outside finance scope]
PL.&gt;AC: FinalAnswerStep (polite redirect, no tools)
..=cf2; AC: [tool needed]
PL.&gt;AC: ToolCallStep
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM: execute(toolCall)
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;T: run(args)
T.&gt;TM: ToolResult
TM.&gt;AC: ToolResult
--=cf2
--=cf1
combinedFragment=alt~cf3 F TRP; F: [LLM unavailable]
AC.&gt;F: AgentResult (status MODEL_UNAVAILABLE, offline message)
..=cf3; F: [answer produced]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;GC: verify(answer, observations)
GC.&gt;AC: GroundingReport
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;TRP: save(trace)
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;MM: remember(task, result)
MM-&gt;&gt;&gt;CM: append(message)
AC.&gt;F: AgentResult
--=cf3
F.&gt;AV: AgentResult
AV.&gt;User: answer
User-&gt;&gt;&gt;AV: click How did you get this?
AV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: getTrace(traceId)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;TRP: load(traceId)
TRP.&gt;F: AgentTrace
F.&gt;AV: AgentTrace
AV.&gt;User: tool calls and data used</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element></diagram>